{"case_id": "female_19830326_P006-Q30", "domain": "unknown", "question": "2019年开始，2021年结束，桃花类型、分手原因？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主癸水生于卯月，木旺泄水，身弱喜金水。2019年己亥，七杀透干，地支亥水为日主根气，但流年与命局亥卯未三合木局（原局有卯，时支午中藏未，流年亥引动），木势更旺，七杀攻身，感情上易遇强势或复杂对象，且亥水为桃花（日支丑中藏子，亥为桃花星），但合木局主感情纠葛。2021年辛丑，偏印透干，地支丑土与日支丑伏吟，且丑午相害、丑未相冲（时支午中藏未），主感情反复、内心压抑，偏印主思虑多、疑心重，易因现实问题（如对方隐瞒）而分手。\n\n综合来看，2019年七杀+桃花，且三合木局，主遇到有魅力但背景复杂之人（如已婚或隐瞒身份），2021年丑土伏吟害午，主欺骗暴露、关系破裂。选项B“已婚男，分手原因：欺骗自己、没离婚”最符合七杀（非正官）代表非正当关系、偏印（辛）主隐瞒欺骗的象义。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "5ab6ef01f10796ed9fcd58e169c95c44872613433a4dd1c76b06bfc2009fafbe", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19830326_P006-Q30", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4469, "response_id": "5f4d7eea-109a-432e-9602-e648a06a9b1e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 528, "completion_tokens": 286, "total_tokens": 814, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 512}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 16}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
